(4104364, 586336, 57421, '<td valign="top">Sorry man but this is a very unappealing photo. It has only 2 things positive: (i) it does convey the idea of wealth (ii) it''s fairly sharp (hell it could have been all blurry!). Apart from that it has got nothing for it. Not even a good candid. Why didn''t you simply take a nice picture of the car from the oustide!?</td>', 'Sorry man but this is a very unappealing photo. It has only 2 things positive: (i) it does convey the idea of wealth (ii) it''s fairly sharp (hell it could have been all blurry!). Apart from that it has got nothing for it. Not even a good candid. Why didn''t you simply take a nice picture of the car from the oustide!?', '2007-09-20 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4104365, 587808, 83920, '<td valign="top">i like it. At first I found the top too distracting, was thinking should have cropped it so it was all sheep... but the lush green grass, hint of water and hills also hints at completing a true farmers gold.<br/>gratz!, hope you do well</td>', 'i like it. At first I found the top too distracting, was thinking should have cropped it so it was all sheep... but the lush green grass, hint of water and hills also hints at completing a true farmers gold.gratz!, hope you do well', '2007-09-20 10:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
