(4107608, 587771, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. A couple of nit-picky things. It is a little hot in the center, and the crop has removed the top of the door framing. I don''t think it needed the whole barrel vaulted ceiling, and you were probably trying to avoid a light fixture or something. But, those two factors hurt your photo. You''ve done a great job with capturing the detail on the walls, ceiling, and railing.</td>', 'This is beautiful. A couple of nit-picky things. It is a little hot in the center, and the crop has removed the top of the door framing. I don''t think it needed the whole barrel vaulted ceiling, and you were probably trying to avoid a light fixture or something. But, those two factors hurt your photo. You''ve done a great job with capturing the detail on the walls, ceiling, and railing.', '2007-09-21 19:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4107614, 586205, 77196, '<td valign="top">Some would argue that Jesus was more anti-wealth, but I understand what you mean. This photo has some technical problems that hurt it a lot. The foreground is out of focus, and the deep shadows of the cross prevent the viewer''s eye from being led into the photo. There is so much blur and shadow that it is not immediately clear what the wood is. I like the book text &amp; charm(?) being in focus.</td>', 'Some would argue that Jesus was more anti-wealth, but I understand what you mean. This photo has some technical problems that hurt it a lot. The foreground is out of focus, and the deep shadows of the cross prevent the viewer''s eye from being led into the photo. There is so much blur and shadow that it is not immediately clear what the wood is. I like the book text & charm(?) being in focus.', '2007-09-21 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4107620, 588298, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure what your focus is here - the stones, the rings, or the pearls? So much of this photo is badly OOF, and there are reflections on the emerald cut stone that makes it not immediately recognizable.</td>', 'Not sure what your focus is here - the stones, the rings, or the pearls? So much of this photo is badly OOF, and there are reflections on the emerald cut stone that makes it not immediately recognizable.', '2007-09-21 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4107621, 586336, 77196, '<td valign="top">Subtle. Nice, but I think it might have been better to have the left foot just off the F, rather than covering part of it. Including the shoes (which don''t look to be particularly unusual or expensive) adds interest.</td>', 'Subtle. Nice, but I think it might have been better to have the left foot just off the F, rather than covering part of it. Including the shoes (which don''t look to be particularly unusual or expensive) adds interest.', '2007-09-21 19:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4107623, 588607, 77196, '<td valign="top">The boats at the right distract from your main focus - the people on the bench.</td>', 'The boats at the right distract from your main focus - the people on the bench.', '2007-09-21 19:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4107626, 588951, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The bright sunlight hurts you here. It put the booty in too much light, and the inside of the lid in blackness. A more evenly lit scene would have worked better - perhaps shading the chest with shadows of pirates...</td>', 'Nice idea. The bright sunlight hurts you here. It put the booty in too much light, and the inside of the lid in blackness. A more evenly lit scene would have worked better - perhaps shading the chest with shadows of pirates...', '2007-09-21 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
