(4108831, 586451, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle in your composition but it''s a bit dark on my monitor.  And I do calibrate.</td>', 'Interesting angle in your composition but it''s a bit dark on my monitor.  And I do calibrate.', '2007-09-22 13:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108832, 587315, 66524, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea...you don''t need the grass interfering with your cornucopia.  A better set up would help this concept.  You are on the right track!</td>', 'Excellent idea...you don''t need the grass interfering with your cornucopia.  A better set up would help this concept.  You are on the right track!', '2007-09-22 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108835, 588374, 66524, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2007-09-22 13:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108865, 588274, 58452, '<td valign="top">The better of the two "burning money" comps I''ve seen so far. I like the exposure on the hand and "money".  I wish all the money had been burning but I like this one.  Very nice.</td>', 'The better of the two "burning money" comps I''ve seen so far. I like the exposure on the hand and "money".  I wish all the money had been burning but I like this one.  Very nice.', '2007-09-22 14:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108867, 588701, 66524, '<td valign="top">It''s a great idea!...but the dollar bill is so centered and prominent that it takes away from your (what I assume is your...)implied valued paper...the photos.  Again, nice thinking!</td>', 'It''s a great idea!...but the dollar bill is so centered and prominent that it takes away from your (what I assume is your...)implied valued paper...the photos.  Again, nice thinking!', '2007-09-22 14:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108875, 588597, 66524, '<td valign="top">great shot!  I hope you do well!  I said "WOW" at the thumbnail.  I''m not an expert, but what I said to myself was "great back lighting, wish the face was brighter"...JMHO</td>', 'great shot!  I hope you do well!  I said "WOW" at the thumbnail.  I''m not an expert, but what I said to myself was "great back lighting, wish the face was brighter"...JMHO', '2007-09-22 14:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108876, 588953, 58452, '<td valign="top">A different concept of wealth.  It''s certainly relative.  I could lose the bright yellow blurred car.  Maybe if you''d moved in close to your subject a smile was there.  Then that truly would have shown that persons wealth. While losing all the distractions in this frame.</td>', 'A different concept of wealth.  It''s certainly relative.  I could lose the bright yellow blurred car.  Maybe if you''d moved in close to your subject a smile was there.  Then that truly would have shown that persons wealth. While losing all the distractions in this frame.', '2007-09-22 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108879, 588780, 66524, '<td valign="top">cute title...I love it!</td>', 'cute title...I love it!', '2007-09-22 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108888, 588756, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective with the distortion of the wide angle. The contrast of the almost blown out wall to the shadow area makes this a difficult composition for me to concentrate on.  Maybe taken at a different time of day, or at night with strategically placed flashes this could be nice.</td>', 'Interesting perspective with the distortion of the wide angle. The contrast of the almost blown out wall to the shadow area makes this a difficult composition for me to concentrate on.  Maybe taken at a different time of day, or at night with strategically placed flashes this could be nice.', '2007-09-22 14:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108892, 588292, 66524, '<td valign="top">indeed!  I love your concept.  Contrasting colors of bottom lid to pupil is brilliant!</td>', 'indeed!  I love your concept.  Contrasting colors of bottom lid to pupil is brilliant!', '2007-09-22 14:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108938, 588593, 58452, '<td valign="top">For this guy that''s a lot of wealth.  There''s something I like about the contrast of JFK in focus in the foreground with unfocused wealth of promise in the back.  We all start that way.  Some of us make it to the foreground. Bumping this up a point as I comment. My personal pick for the blue.</td>', 'For this guy that''s a lot of wealth.  There''s something I like about the contrast of JFK in focus in the foreground with unfocused wealth of promise in the back.  We all start that way.  Some of us make it to the foreground. Bumping this up a point as I comment. My personal pick for the blue.', '2007-09-22 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4109469, 587139, 84520, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting</td>', 'Excellent lighting', '2007-09-22 22:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4109473, 586861, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the contrash between the tree and the sky is too low</td>', 'I like the composition but the contrash between the tree and the sky is too low', '2007-09-22 22:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4109705, 587139, 40053, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot...i just wish that you could have changed the lighting slightly so that the  maple leafs stood out more.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot...i just wish that you could have changed the lighting slightly so that the  maple leafs stood out more.', '2007-09-23 01:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4109711, 586471, 40053, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the grain is distracting or not.  I''m tending to think that if I can''t tell if it is or not then I''m leaning towards distracting and should be removed.  The composition of the Photo is very good, and the subtle lighting is great.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the grain is distracting or not.  I''m tending to think that if I can''t tell if it is or not then I''m leaning towards distracting and should be removed.  The composition of the Photo is very good, and the subtle lighting is great.', '2007-09-23 01:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4109716, 588283, 40053, '<td valign="top">The shadow to the right of the flag is seriously distracting.....a different crop would have made this more interesting.</td>', 'The shadow to the right of the flag is seriously distracting.....a different crop would have made this more interesting.', '2007-09-23 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
