(4120403, 585858, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful picture.  Congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon.  But how sad that Saudis are so intolerant as to prohibit non-Muslims from visiting this place.  I guess that''s why I respect Omanis; they welcome everyone to visit their Grand Mosque.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-28 04:57:29.</i></td>', 'Very beautiful picture.  Congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon.  But how sad that Saudis are so intolerant as to prohibit non-Muslims from visiting this place.  I guess that''s why I respect Omanis; they welcome everyone to visit their Grand Mosque.', '2007-09-27 15:26:03.000000', '2007-09-28 05:57:29.000000', 0),
