(4120861, 588482, 76430, '<td valign="top">I supposed I should have guessed you did this, Stephen, since the lighthouse looks a little like a white rook.  If the meaning is not obvious, as it wasn''t here, I''d recommend putting in a title that would explain it, something like "Priceless for a Ship''s Captain".  Also, I notice that some of your pictures seem to have a soft focus look.  Looking at the page for the DiMAGE 7 and others of yours there are many sharp pictures.  It may be due to insufficient light but I''d recommend you make sure your optics are nice and clean, and maybe do some postprocessing color and sharpness adjustment, but not as much as your Windy and Cloudy Day that showed halo effect.</td>', 'I supposed I should have guessed you did this, Stephen, since the lighthouse looks a little like a white rook.  If the meaning is not obvious, as it wasn''t here, I''d recommend putting in a title that would explain it, something like "Priceless for a Ship''s Captain".  Also, I notice that some of your pictures seem to have a soft focus look.  Looking at the page for the DiMAGE 7 and others of yours there are many sharp pictures.  It may be due to insufficient light but I''d recommend you make sure your optics are nice and clean, and maybe do some postprocessing color and sharpness adjustment, but not as much as your Windy and Cloudy Day that showed halo effect.', '2007-09-27 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4121329, 585858, 77953, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everybody, I am sad for the ones how wish to visit such place, thats the rules, what can we do, put I promise to do my best to make you see more pictures to fill the willing to visit the place, it is a magnificent place with all the measures.<br/> <br/>My best wishes.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for everybody, I am sad for the ones how wish to visit such place, thats the rules, what can we do, put I promise to do my best to make you see more pictures to fill the willing to visit the place, it is a magnificent place with all the measures. My best wishes.', '2007-09-27 23:11:07.000000', NULL, 0),
