(4124042, 586593, 27482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nutzito:</b></div><hr/><i> you have won a ribbon in a 100% of your entries so far!! that must be a record :-).</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not really, I can think of at least 3 other people who ribboned on their first entry and I am sure I could find more if I went looking but that doesn´t take anything away from the author of this photograh, congrats on your ribbon :)</td>', 'Originally posted by nutzito: you have won a ribbon in a 100% of your entries so far!! that must be a record :-).  Not really, I can think of at least 3 other people who ribboned on their first entry and I am sure I could find more if I went looking but that doesn´t take anything away from the author of this photograh, congrats on your ribbon :)', '2007-09-29 08:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
