(4129767, 588865, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/>First let me congratulate you a new personal best score.  I know you were probably hoping for a little higher but your score indicates that the image was technically strong and meet the challenge description.  Where the image falls short is in the DPC "Wow" factor.  Nearly 40% of your votes were 5''s.  That to me suggests that the voters looked for literally 2-3 seconds and concluded, "this picture isn''t bad, so I can''t give 4 or less, but it doesn''t do that much for me so I can''t give 6 or more".  <br/> <br/>You did a nice job trying to eliminate distractions in this image.  However, the cars visible on both sides of the Shelby indicate that your image was taken at a car show of some sort.  This gives the image a walk-by-shooting look that lacks the creativity that the DPC voters look for.  <br/> <br/>Feel free to send me a PM if you have any questions regarding this critique.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club, First let me congratulate you a new personal best score.  I know you were probably hoping for a little higher but your score indicates that the image was technically strong and meet the challenge description.  Where the image falls short is in the DPC "Wow" factor.  Nearly 40% of your votes were 5''s.  That to me suggests that the voters looked for literally 2-3 seconds and concluded, "this picture isn''t bad, so I can''t give 4 or less, but it doesn''t do that much for me so I can''t give 6 or more".   You did a nice job trying to eliminate distractions in this image.  However, the cars visible on both sides of the Shelby indicate that your image was taken at a car show of some sort.  This gives the image a walk-by-shooting look that lacks the creativity that the DPC voters look for.   Feel free to send me a PM if you have any questions regarding this critique. Tim', '2007-10-01 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4129818, 588950, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/>It is amazing what you accomplished in post processing considering what you started with.  You almost turned a piece of coal into a diamond.  Sorry this critique doesn''t contain more substance but you got everything out of this image that could be got.  Nicely done.  <br/> <br/>Feel free to send me a PM if you have any questions regarding this critique.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club, It is amazing what you accomplished in post processing considering what you started with.  You almost turned a piece of coal into a diamond.  Sorry this critique doesn''t contain more substance but you got everything out of this image that could be got.  Nicely done.   Feel free to send me a PM if you have any questions regarding this critique. Tim', '2007-10-01 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4129867, 585858, 84405, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL! SIMPLY GORGEOUS!<br/>You should be soooo proud of this shot!<br/>WOW!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL! SIMPLY GORGEOUS!You should be soooo proud of this shot!WOW!', '2007-10-01 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4131047, 585858, 76430, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if you were the same photographer who submitted <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=519082" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> and I see you are.  This one is much improved in quality from the other one.  Excellent picture and well deserved ribbon.  Would you please submit your settings?  It looks like a short exposure in twilight that is very sharp, which are very hard to get all of (fast, bright, sharp; pick two).</td>', 'I was wondering if you were the same photographer who submitted this and I see you are.  This one is much improved in quality from the other one.  Excellent picture and well deserved ribbon.  Would you please submit your settings?  It looks like a short exposure in twilight that is very sharp, which are very hard to get all of (fast, bright, sharp; pick two).', '2007-10-01 21:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
