(4286848, 586713, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like this and I am no good speler and wouldn''t have noticed the title.<br/>I noticed a few people said it would have been better off to one side, I disagree, I think it would have been cool dead center, but make sure it is perfectly vertical, it seems to be leaning to the right. it has a nice ominous feel to it.</td>', 'I like this and I am no good speler and wouldn''t have noticed the title.I noticed a few people said it would have been better off to one side, I disagree, I think it would have been cool dead center, but make sure it is perfectly vertical, it seems to be leaning to the right. it has a nice ominous feel to it.', '2007-12-03 20:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
